     "COL_SEASON_S10A_PAGE_01": {
      "LockedTexture": "/Game/UI/Textures/HuntpassRewards/2020_Season10a/ico_comics.ico_comics",
      "UnlockedTexture": "/Game/UI/Textures/HuntpassRewards/2020_Season10a/ui_comic_chronicles_10_A_01.ui_comic_chronicles_10_A_01",
      "LongDescription": "After we’d spent a few hours spelunking through the upper tunnels and cave system of these umbral-saturated islands, the team stopped briefly at a fork in the path to rest up for a moment. Restless, I set out to explore one of the side passages we’d passed on the way. I could have sworn I’d seen a glimmer of reflected light worth investigating within the oily shadows. \r\n\r\nI only made it perhaps twenty metres down the tunnel when it rounded a sharp bend and opened into a cavern illuminated from a single source: a magnificent and clearly ancient golden blade. There’s power in the Umbral Deeps. Power we barely understand. Could it save our city? \r\n\r\n        — Dr. Shaed Priyani’s Field Journal",
      "LockedDescription": "???",
      "DisplayName": "Light in the Ruins",
      "Description": "The good doctor makes a glowing discovery.",
