     "COL_SEASON_S10A_PAGE_03": {
      "LockedTexture": "/Game/UI/Textures/HuntpassRewards/2020_Season10a/ico_comics.ico_comics",
      "UnlockedTexture": "/Game/UI/Textures/HuntpassRewards/2020_Season10a/ui_comic_chronicles_10_A_03.ui_comic_chronicles_10_A_03",
      "LongDescription": "The Behemoth depicted in the wall carving appears to possess annelid and insect elements—part worm, part bug, as Kat might describe it. Called to mind the megapede that gave me a nasty sting on the expedition to the Krolachi Highlands. As a scientist I'm naturally intrigued, even eager, to learn more about this beast—but as a human being who has already lost enough to the Behemoths, I hope it died out long ago.\r\n\r\nBut it's the strange artifact the Behemoth has coiled itself around that really concerns me. I believe I'm looking at a depiction of relic Void Runner technology, and whoever carved this image meant to show a bond between beast and machine.\r\n\r\n        — Dr. Shaed Priyani’s Field Journal",
      "LockedDescription": "???",
      "DisplayName": "What Evil Lurks",
      "Description": "Doctor Priyani and her team make an unsettling find.",
